stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed: Initial State

    Closed --> Closed: record_success()
    Closed --> Open: N consecutive failures<br/>(threshold reached)

    Open --> Open: All calls rejected<br/>(CircuitOpenError)
    Open --> HalfOpen: Recovery timeout elapsed

    HalfOpen --> Closed: Probe calls succeed
    HalfOpen --> Open: Any probe fails

    state "Circuit Breaker States" as CBS {
        Closed: All calls pass through
        Open: All calls rejected instantly
        HalfOpen: Limited probe calls allowed
    }
